{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124233","id":4763157359,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-gDbw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124233.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124233/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124233/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124233/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/73396e9add9933aa7a0467516184d795299f6ae3","number":124233,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Harden Linux executables with `PIE` and `RELRO`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nImproves security against offset table rewrites and ROP attacks by enabling `PIE` and `RELRO`.\r\nAs far as I'm aware both have negligible cost and should have been enabled long ago.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- position-independent executable (PIE): unlocks address-space layout randomization (ASLR). This protects against ROP attacks, where attackers can use known code layout to their advantage.\r\n- relocation read-only (RELRO): prevents attackers from overwriting global offset tables, which attackers can use to replace functions with their own malicious code.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4212746784,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc77GWog","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:3.5","name":"cherrypick:3.5","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 3.5.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6132313027,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbYOrww","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.2","name":"cherrypick:4.2","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.2.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godote